sequenceDiagram
autonumber
participant LMS as LMS (Instructor)
participant LTIGW as LTI Gateway
participant DLC as DeepLinkController
participant DLS as DeepLinkService

LMS->>LTIGW: Deep Link Launch Request
LTIGW->>DLC: Forward Request
DLC->>DLS: Process Deep Link Request

DLS-->>DLC: Provide Content Selection UI Payload
DLC-->>LMS: Display Tool Configuration UI

LMS->>LTIGW: Instructor Selects Content
LTIGW->>DLC: Return Selection Data
DLC->>DLS: Generate Deep Link Response (JWT)

DLS-->>DLC: Deep Link JWT Ready
DLC-->>LMS: Return DeepLinkResponse (Add to Course)
